# Pumblo requires no secrets or third-party service credentials.
#
# Local development:
# - Vinext/Miniflare creates local D1 and R2 stores under .wrangler/.
# - /api/dev-session supplies development-only test identities.
#
# Production on Sites:
# - Sign in with ChatGPT is injected by the hosting dispatcher.
# - D1 and R2 are provisioned from .openai/hosting.json.
